xes; reacts to being called a redistributionist by McCain; notes he has some ideas for people in his cabinet with Republicans in it with a non-partisan national security policy; admits he has thought about what would happen if he loses on November 4th.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.  \n\n(Miami: Ron Claiborne)  McCain's hammering of Obama on national security and the importance of the race in Florida featured; scenes shown from Miami.  [McCAIN&nbsp- criticizes Obama's infomercial.]  [In Tampa, McCAIN&nbsp- raises the question  of whether Obama can protect the US from threats; criticizes Obama on higher taxes.]  {ABC News political director David CHALIAN&#134;- says Florida is the big prize among battleground states.]  \"Los Angeles Times\"/Bloomberg statistics on the early vote in Florida cited.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The tough talk last night from Governor Sarah Palin that Obama might want to rewrite the Constitution recalled.  [With Elizabeth Vargas, PALIN&nbsp- states she is not calling someone out on their level of patriotism.] ", "segment_duration": 570, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909810, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "d4a0AirhGh", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909809, "segment_id": "doC1PLs3xL", "segment_broadcast_id": "d4a0AirhGh", "segment_title": "Economy: Interest Rates", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The Federal Reserve's cut of a key interest rate noted; Stock Market Report.  \n\n(Studio: Betsy Stark)  The Fed's year-long cut in interest rates